data: {"id": "32e6484ae7cc4bb4-thinking-parallel_evidence-1258", "run_id": "32e6484ae7cc4bb4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有的真实工具结果，我已采集到以下关键事实：\n\n## 已确认的实体身份\n- **Pod**: `workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn`，命名空间 `aiops-case-07`，UID `bffd1771-cb0a-4bea-96ed-0a46e5b3a923`\n- 节点: `node2`，创建时间 `2026-09-07T14:35:13Z`\n\n## 支持 CrashLoopBackOff 的事实\n\n1. **Kubernetes 状态**（`kubectl_get_yaml` + `kubectl_describe`）:\n   - Phase: Running（Pod 本身未被删除）\n   - 容器 `app` 的 ready=False，reason=`ContainersNotReady`\n   - `restarts=8`，reason=`CrashLoopBackOff`，exitCode=78\n   - 事件: `Back-off restarting failed container app`，持续时间 18 分钟内 64 次\n\n2. **应用日志**（", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788792886707, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

